act they're kind of  the exception to the left and most  guesses it would be interesting to see  if that contingency starts to grow more  or fades away over time yeah the  contingent yeah that's a good question  I think that  they are eventually going to fade away  that's my view on it we've got a great  bonus show for you today david  pakman.com slash membership patreon.com  slash david pakman show don't miss the  bonus show it's a good one today
 

